License: LGPL-2.1+
Comment: Ported from FFmpeg libavcodec/mace.c. The decoder is compiled
 into /usr/share/finsical/web/bundle.js and addons.js, which carry its
 license header. Its readable source ships as
 /usr/share/finsical/core/data/mace.ts; in the upstream repository,
 `npm run build` rebuilds the bundles from it. See
 /usr/share/doc/finsical/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

